# Headed first-party editing through Graphshell's resident Knot route.
# The receipt harness seeds knot://vault/field-note, launches the resident,
# and sets TURNSTONE_KNOT_MODE=persona-vault plus its isolated app endpoint.
settle 20
key escape
open knot://vault/field-note
settle 5
act Toggle live content
wait
assert content-live
assert snap focused ~ field-note
assert text Resident V1
# This receipt's headed viewport is 1024x600. Probe's generic selector currently
# re-lays out this DOM and lands beyond the textarea that Turnstone painted.
click-at 480 65
key end
key space
insert headed edit
assert text Resident V1 headed edit
key ctrl+s
wait
assert text saved
capture 01_resident_edit
settle 300
act Toggle live content
settle 5
assert no-surface content
capture 02_resident_after_close
log Resident Knot edit and pane-close crossed the first-party route
